'''4D Cyclops''' (時空のサイクロプス, ''Jikū no Saikoropusu'') is an enemy appearing in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 4D Cyclops
|image = E 228.png
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500円 - 5,925円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is pretty much an exact copy of it's [[Cyclops (Enemy)|other counterpart]], just with slightly higher health and attack.

==Strategy==
The strategy used to defeat the original Cyclops enemy can also be used for this enemy as the only difference is health and damage.

